# Local-only Claude context — never push (see CLAUDE.md § Session journaling)
docs/SESSION_JOURNAL.md

# v1.15.44: agent-written audit artifacts. They're scratch output from
# multi-agent code-audit cycles (silent-failure / concurrency / etc) —
# valuable as local working notes but not for the repo. AUDIT_*.md
# catches new ones; the two pre-convention files are listed by name.
docs/AUDIT_*.md
docs/CODEBASE_AUDIT.md
docs/INFO_CARD_AUDIT.md

# v1.21.17 (security audit): guardrail against committing real secrets if
# motif is ever run from this source checkout (prod keeps these in the
# /config volume, so nothing here today — belt-and-suspenders). The YouTube
# cookie jar, the config file (carries the Plex token), and the SQLite DB
# (carries session + api-token hashes) must never be tracked.
cookies.txt
motif.yaml
motif.yml
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.sqlite
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key

# 0.50.0: local-only list of personal strings (homelab IP, hostname, etc.) the
# secrets-leak guard scans tracked source for. Kept OUT of the repo so the guard
# names nothing public; absent on a fresh clone / CI (guard is a no-op there).
tests/personal_strings.local
